WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,990 --> 00:00:08,870
Dad, this, Dad, give this to Mom

2
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:12,980
Slow down. My feet hurt.

3
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:27,060
Mom is crazy

4
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:31,520
Is it right for babies to find their mothers?

5
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:33,920
Dad goes to see me and shamelessly contacts me tonight.

6
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:42,020
So in that world, Rainbow Dash only needs to find her mother

7
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:43,060
I will cry

8
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:44,180
I've been so miserable

9
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:45,540
No need to think about it

10
00:00:45,540 --> 00:00:46,540
Who dares to abandon me in this world?

11
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:49,100
Except Linjing, no one else is Rainbow Dash

12
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:52,210
Dad promises you will see mom soon, is it true?

13
00:00:52,210 --> 00:01:12,420
Shame? Tomorrow

14
00:01:12,420 --> 00:01:13,660
Dad will go to the mall tomorrow

15
00:01:13,660 --> 00:01:14,940
Make sure you buy a lot of toys

16
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:16,780
So many?

17
00:01:16,780 --> 00:01:17,980
Well, so much

18
00:01:19,820 --> 00:01:20,900
Dad's

19
00:01:21,300 --> 00:01:22,300
your play

20
00:01:24,540 --> 00:01:25,460
I'm going to die
